        "original_id": "3d40f4e9-e479-504f-b71d-7c40b1e05de3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tyler Bunch, Jerry Nelson, Peter Linz\n- Characters: Herry Monster\n- TV shows: Person of Interest, Sesame Street\n- Video games: Red Dead Redemption, Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Revolver\n- Companies: Rockstar San Diego, Rockstar Games\n\nFacts:\n- Jerry Nelson performed Herry Monster on Sesame Street from 1970 to 2003.\n- Tyler Bunch acted in a few Off Broadway productions and appeared on American television shows including Person of Interest.\n- Tyler Bunch appeared in video games including Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Redemption, and Red Dead Revolver.\n- Tyler Bunch performed Herry Monster in 2013.\n- Peter Linz has performed Herry Monster since 2017.\n- Red Dead Redemption is a Western action-adventure video game developed by Rockstar San Diego and published by Rockstar Games.",
